        "section_index": null,
        "text": "The entrance is hidden amongst the limestone outcrops and descends immediately to around 8m. Bolt placed and backed up around natural features. \"It keeps going and has a small dog leg in the shaft which requires an additional bolt placement for a deviation cord. Drops into a chamber with a pool of water. Still going routes off.\""
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "section_index": null,
        "text": "The shaft was explored in July 2025 - photos were taken but there is no log book entry."
      }
